      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's understandable that you feel skeptical, especially when the foundation of your life has crumbled so completely. When everything feels like a lie, the idea of \"navigating\" something is absurd; you're facing an existential crisis, and that requires more than a quick fix. Instead of trying to build on the old ground, perhaps the only honest thing is to let the void be what it is for a while. Sometimes the only way forward is to stop fighting the emptiness and just allow yourself to feel the weight of it without needing an immediate answer.",
      "source": "target",
